Parts of metal-eq come from SILENTARMY (https://github.com/mbevand/silentarmy):
blake.c, blake.h, sha256.c and sha256.h are copied unchanged, equihash.metal is
a port of its OpenCL kernels (input.cl), metal_eq.m keeps its host helpers and
mining protocol (main.c), and the round-0 BLAKE2b code in equihash_v2.metal
follows input.cl. These parts are under SILENTARMY's license:

